        "effect": "The sticky greeter lurches as its abdomen snaps forward, opens, and sprays the triggering creature with thick sheets of alchemical webbing. At the same time, the sticky greeter emits a high-pitched whistling sound. The creature must make a DC 26 Reflex save or become immobilized and held in place, or restrained on a critical failure until it escapes (DC 22) or the webbing binding it is destroyed.",
